# 🚩 Challenge: [Ready Gladiator 2]
![alt text](gladiator2.png)
## 📝 Challenge Description
Can you make a CoreWars warrior that wins every single round? Your opponent is the Imp. The source is available here
. If you wanted to pit the Imp against himself, you could download the Imp and connect to the CoreWars server like this:

nc xebec.cylabacademy.net 32251 < imp.red

To get the flag, you must beat the Imp all 100 rounds.

Instance
Expires in 10:43
Hints
1. If your warrior is close, try again, it may work on subsequent tries... why is that?

### Code / Terminal Snippets
```bash
1. wget 
2. nano imp.red

;redcode
;name Imp Killer
;assert 1
jmp 0,<-2
end
3. nc xebec.cylabacademy.net  20433< imp.red

```

