## 🚀 Exploitation / Solution Path
Detail your step-by-step breakdown to get the flag:
1. Download the file from the challenge using `wget`.
2. Open the `imp.red` file using `nano` or any text editor and change the code into how it looks in `step2 of code/terminal snippets`. 
3. Main logic is to win atleast one game to get the flag.
4. Run this netcat session `nc xebec.cylabacademy.net 32251 < imp.red` and the flag will be diplayed.
 
